OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who murdered uni housemate
OL,4,Ajailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has been jailed for life with
OL,7,Fa minimum term of 28 years for
OL,8,Fmurdering his university housemate
OL,9,Fafter lying in wait and stabbing him 30
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,12,FZack Coughlan, 23, dressed in black and
OL,13,Fwore a mask to ambush Jamie Collins,
OL,14,F21, in the garden of their home near
OL,15,FBristol on 8 April.
OL,17,FCoughlan left his victim dying in an
OL,18,Falleyway next to the home they shared
OL,19,Fin Filton as he cycled away to dispose
OL,20,Fof bloodstained evidence. He called
OL,21,Fpolice eight hours later.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
